            {"title": "6. Building Holy Habits", "body_md": "Faith grows through gentle, repeated habits, not grand efforts:\n\n- **Pray together** morning and night, and grace at meals.\n- **Go to Sunday Mass** as the unmissable heart of the week.\n- **Confess** regularly as a family.\n- **Read** a Bible story or saint's life at bedtime.\n- **Bless** your children — a small cross on the forehead each night.\n\nBe patient and joyful. You are planting seeds that God Himself will bring to harvest. Do small things with great love, and trust the Lord with the rest."},
